{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13310400","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13310400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1331040001:1":{"text":"콜록, 여보. 여러 번 말했잖아. 작년 그 일은 내 잘못만은 아니었다고.","source_cn":"咳咳，亲爱的，我已经和你解释过很多次，去年的事情不能全怪我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x971D3CD2974863EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1331040002:1":{"text":"당신 분장이 너무 잘 됐고, 무도회 조명이 너무 어두워서...","source_cn":"你去年舞会的妆实在化的太好，而且当时舞会的光线太暗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA31A2AE9F05E8AC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1331040003:0":{"text":"여보, 올해는 절대로 당신을 잃어버리지 않을게.","source_cn":"亲爱的，希望你今年不会再次弄丢自己的老婆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF66BE48408FBAB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:镇民奥利维":{"text":"주민 올리브","source":"镇民奥利维","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:镇民娜杰":{"text":"주민 나디아","source":"镇民娜杰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}